    "detailed_description": "[h1]Nachzehrer[/h1]<br>Your fear of being in the dark comes true in this short single player horror game. You find yourself stuck at a power plant at night, when suddenly the lights begin shutting off. However, attempting to turn them back on may cause you to meet your fears.<br><br>Enjoy this short horror game that attempts to use a unique horror tactic that has never been used in other games. See if you can figure out how to prevent your fears from seeing you!",
